# Structure checkpoint directory.
#
# Expected files (real copies, not symlinks):
#   structure_best.pt   — window structure AST weights (~300MB, not committed)
#   vocab.json          — tokenizer / field vocab
#   railing_best.pt     — balcony solid/baluster linear head (small; commit after train)
#
# Window binaries are gitignored. Copy them in, e.g.:
#   cp /path/to/best.pt structure_best.pt
#   cp /path/to/vocab.json vocab.json
#
# Train the railing head:
#   python balcony_train/train.py --device cuda
#
# Or pass:  python run.py --structure-ckpt /path/to/best.pt
